caption: Unlocks
species-component: unlocks

Developmental Unlock: Flight (Super, -10%) [36]. A developing Goldblood may purchase Flight beginning at age 6 through the formal Goldblood Super-training program, before full adult Species qualification. It is a stable intrinsic Super ability and is fully point-paid. Once the character meets the normal Singular Powers point-value limit, this Flight may be designated as the character's Singular Power and can satisfy that Tier 1 Tradition's purchase requirement; Singular Powers mastery still requires its normal consequential uses.

Once fully qualified as Goldblood, the character may purchase most of the stable traits demonstrated by the Firstborn Pattern:

- Enhanced Time Sense.

- Extra Attack 1.

- Fearlessness up to 5.

- Unaging.

- Regrowth.

- Regeneration (Slow), which may later be improved to Regular.

- Doesn’t Sleep, replacing Less Sleep.

- Hard to Kill up to 3.

- Hard to Subdue up to 3.

- Further engineered senses and nervous-system refinements.

These are point-paid adult expressions of Goldblood potential. They are not automatically possessed by ordinary Goldbloods, and buying them does not make the character a Firstborn Pattern subject.
